          "settings": {
            "enable_media": false,
            "title": "EXTREME",
            "text": "<p>The lowest temperature a typical adult woman can endure for up to 6 hours, curled up tightly with her knees drawn in. The body shivers to generate heat. At this temperature there is a serious risk of hypothermia, and it is extremely dangerous.</p>",
